&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with Develocity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;JVM language experience (Java, Kotlin).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with customer-facing and executive-level incident communications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
